      "q": "1. Which of the following is the correct IUPAC name?\n(i) 3-Ethyl-4, 4-dimethylheptane\n(ii) 4,4-Dimethyl-3-ethylheptane\n(iii) 5-Ethyl-4, 4-dimethylheptane\n(iv) 4,4-Bis(methyl)-3-ethylheptane",
